;ACHE WAS PHOSPHONYLATED WITH VX, THE CONJUGATE WAS
CRYSTALLIZED, AND SUBSEQUENTLY ALLOWED TO UNDERGO
COMPLETE AGING (DEALKYLATION OF THE OP ETHYL GROUP). THE
STRUCTURE OF THE OP-ACHE CONJUGATE BEFORE AGING ALSO WAS
SOLVED BY X-RAY DIFFRACTION, AND IS DEPOSITED UNDER A
SEPARATE PDB ACCESSION CODE.
;
